---
name: weather-brief
description: >
  Generate a one-line weather brief for a city. Use whenever the user asks
  for today's weather in a short text form, e.g. "上海天气一句话".
---

# Weather Brief

## Workflow
1. Read city from user input.
2. Call weather API (requests) with WEATHER_API_KEY.
3. Format a 50-char markdown brief.
4. Return it.

## Edge Cases
- Empty city → return friendly error.
- Unknown city → suggest nearby city.
